{
  "_note": "LA ARBOLEDA REGIONAL. Species identity, botanical status, habitat, palettes and complete silhouette recipes live here. The Canvas interpreter owns only a finite geometry vocabulary; it never branches on a species id. `observed_local` means documented in Puntarenas, not automatically native.",
